<h2>16. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When changes are made, we will update the "Last Updated" date shown at the top of this page. Where appropriate, significant changes may be communicated through the Service or other suitable means.</p>

